      "content": "The idea that you can't be present again is a heavy burden, but it's also a very real and understandable feeling when everything feels like it's been stripped away. If the life you're trying to live isn't yours, then maybe the most immediate step is to stop trying to live *it*. You deserve a quiet, honest moment where you don't have to pretend to fit into someone else's script.",
