    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "stop trying to live it... what does that even mean? it's just so exhausting to wake up every day and realize that i'm basically dead to everyone i ever cared about. it feels like the only thing left to do is just... fade out. like, if i'm already a ghost, why am i still struggling so hard to stay visible?",
